{"3961900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cosplay Shop Simulator", "steam_appid": 3961900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the ultimate haven for anime fans and cosplay lovers ... in Japan!</strong><br><br><br>In <i>Cosplay Shop Simulator</i>, you run your very own cosplay store; a colourful, chaotic, and endlessly creative business where passion meets profit. Stock your shelves with <strong>anime comics, collectible figurines, detailed props, iconic masks, themed hats</strong>, and so much more!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961900/extras/fafc6d84c514684b41a461248d007fb9.poster.avif?t=1766055170\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961900/extras/fafc6d84c514684b41a461248d007fb9.webm?t=1766055170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961900/extras/fafc6d84c514684b41a461248d007fb9.mp4?t=1766055170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎭 <strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛍️ <strong>Build &amp; Customize Your Dream Shop</strong><br>Design your store from the ground up — choose layouts, decorate with flair, and make your shop the go-to destination for every otaku in town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💸 <strong>Sell &amp; Serve With Style</strong><br>Handle daily sales, restock popular items, and don’t forget to <strong>give correct change</strong> to your loyal (and sometimes impatient) customers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤖 <strong>Hire Entertaining Mascots</strong><br>Bring your shop to life with adorable <strong>dancing mascots</strong> that keep your guests smiling and spending longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 <strong>Grow Your Cosplay Empire</strong><br>Expand your store, open storages, and become a household name in the cosplay world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👥 <strong>Customer Chaos &amp; Events</strong><br>Manage rush hours, fan conventions, and surprise visits! Can you handle the ultimate cosplay rush?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌟 <strong>Your Shop, Your Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re a business mastermind or a cosplay enthusiast, <i>Cosplay Shop Simulator</i> lets you live your dream of running the most exciting, creative, and fan-fueled store in the city of Japan. Build it, grow it, and make your mark in the world of cosplay culture!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the ultimate haven for anime fans and cosplay lovers ... in Japan!</strong><br><br><br>In <i>Cosplay Shop Simulator</i>, you run your very own cosplay store; a colourful, chaotic, and endlessly creative business where passion meets profit. Stock your shelves with <strong>anime comics, collectible figurines, detailed props, iconic masks, themed hats</strong>, and so much more!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961900/extras/fafc6d84c514684b41a461248d007fb9.poster.avif?t=1766055170\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961900/extras/fafc6d84c514684b41a461248d007fb9.webm?t=1766055170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961900/extras/fafc6d84c514684b41a461248d007fb9.mp4?t=1766055170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎭 <strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛍️ <strong>Build &amp; Customize Your Dream Shop</strong><br>Design your store from the ground up — choose layouts, decorate with flair, and make your shop the go-to destination for every otaku in town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💸 <strong>Sell &amp; Serve With Style</strong><br>Handle daily sales, restock popular items, and don’t forget to <strong>give correct change</strong> to your loyal (and sometimes impatient) customers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🤖 <strong>Hire Entertaining Mascots</strong><br>Bring your shop to life with adorable <strong>dancing mascots</strong> that keep your guests smiling and spending longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 <strong>Grow Your Cosplay Empire</strong><br>Expand your store, open storages, and become a household name in the cosplay world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👥 <strong>Customer Chaos &amp; Events</strong><br>Manage rush hours, fan conventions, and surprise visits! Can you handle the ultimate cosplay rush?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌟 <strong>Your Shop, Your Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re a business mastermind or a cosplay enthusiast, <i>Cosplay Shop Simulator</i> lets you live your dream of running the most exciting, creative, and fan-fueled store in the city of Japan. Build it, grow it, and make your mark in the world of cosplay culture!</p>", "short_description": "In Cosplay Shop Simulator you run your very own cosplay store - a colorful and endlessly creative business where passion meets profit. Stock your shelves with anime comics, collectible figurines, detailed props, iconic masks, themed hats, and so much more! Customize, hire staff, dancers and more!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961900/3d8734aedf0bb7348cb2fba1b669f3856ac85526/header.jpg?t=1766055170", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961900/de66fe0cee64524de0f03a623c5f48b0abd